  description: '"Chimera the Flying Mythical Beast" + 1+ Illusion monsters

    This
    card''s name becomes "Chimera the Flying Mythical Beast" while on the field or
    in the GY. This card can attack monsters a number of times each Battle Phase,
    up to the number of materials used for it. If this card battles a monster, neither
    can be destroyed by that battle. At the end of the Damage Step, if this card
    battled an opponent''s monster: You can change that opponent''s monster''s ATK
    to 0, also negate its effects.'
